1869+ 73C5 30 17            jr   nc, .not_nasty
1870+ 73C7
1871+ 73C7                  ; 2. Calcola riga di layout: r = Y / 8
1872+ 73C7 CB 3F            srl  a
1873+ 73C9 CB 3F            srl  a
1874+ 73CB CB 3F            srl  a                 ; A = r (0..15)
