1849+ 80B0
1850+ 80B0 23               inc  hl
1851+ 80B1 46               ld   b, (hl)           ; B = Y
1852+ 80B2
1853+ 80B2 23               inc  hl                ; salta Color
1854+ 80B3
1855+ 80B3 23               inc  hl                ; punta a Collected
1856+ 80B4
1857+ 80B4 7E               ld   a, (hl)
1858+ 80B5
1859+ 80B5                  ; ---------------------------------------------------------------
